        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: St. John's College\n- Places: Belize, Belize City, Tobacco Caye, Dangriga\n- People: Jorge Espat\n- Concepts: Liberal arts education, liberal arts, science courses\n- Roles: instructor, president\n\nFacts:\n- Liberal arts education traditionally centered on grammar, logic, and rhetoric, with arithmetic, geometry, the theory of music, and astronomy also included.\n- St. John's College in Belize offers liberal arts and science courses through three divisions at the secondary, British A-level, and United States junior college levels.\n- Jorge Espat served on the faculty of St. John's College in Belize City first as an instructor and later as president.\n- Tobacco Caye is a tiny island in Belize located about 10 miles east of Dangriga.",
